{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29835","headline":"赠田叟 · 李商隐","name":"赠田叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荷蓧衰翁似有情，相逢携手遶村行。\n烧畲晓映远山色，伐树暝传深谷声。\n鸥鸟忘机翻浃洽，交亲得路昧平生。\n抚躬道直诚感激，在野无贤心自惊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29835.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29835","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}